    "$t": "台灣好食mi̍h - 牽手無tī--leh ê早頓"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《牽手無tī--leh ê早頓》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">盧繼寶</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiFrefujz3BvGCbg6Kmgej-ADfqqK6c1PCZ1dVaH1pleLgpdGoM_3Li_2W0E_WZ6aZBM36Ov_nkbbqMH0p56VpOTRiohC_1fLsjq7A0WkKwzgceDla_FfNEzhVTWZYoK5UH9EGwdZXe_nUUzgkqiec2be28BOp0nheH0zkY3HrU4OLIGNTLMlUgtZ272zDJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiFrefujz3BvGCbg6Kmgej-ADfqqK6c1PCZ1dVaH1pleLgpdGoM_3Li_2W0E_WZ6aZBM36Ov_nkbbqMH0p56VpOTRiohC_1fLsjq7A0WkKwzgceDla_FfNEzhVTWZYoK5UH9EGwdZXe_nUUzgkqiec2be28BOp0nheH0zkY3HrU4OLIGNTLMlUgtZ272zDJ=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">透早睏醒，隨警覺牽手無tī--leh，早頓ài家己款--looh！食麵好--ah。冷ki-ki，穿外套出門，凊彩挽一把烏甜仔，野生--ê，koh生tī家己ê園--裡，保證無毒、無化學肥，入門，khí-moo一直giang--起-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hiânn一khann水ê時，kā烏甜仔洗清氣了，提真有來歷ê白蝦仔五尾，退冰。講白蝦仔有來歷，m̄是lām-sám講講--leh，tī蝦農in兜買蝦仔，拄好拄著指導飼蝦仔ê農業博士，伊自信滿滿講：「養殖池絕對無掖任何藥物、抗生素等等，磨kah幼幼幼ê飼料lóng總ē-tàng消化吸收，所以池底khah bē無蝦仔ê屎尿，一公斤飼料真穩定收成一斤蝦仔，九噸飼料就是收成九千斤蝦仔，而且蝦仔ê腸仔是清氣--ê，免去除……。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">想到tsia，想起hit工tī蝦場無限量供應試食ê鬧熱，koh歡歡喜喜提出我自產自銷、家己飼、無針無藥ê幾隻仔卵雞所生ê雞卵兩粒，款好勢，等待水滾。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">水滾，先hē麵條，幾分鐘後，koh khà雞卵兼hē烏甜仔落--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「熟--ah！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hôo--起-來，té踮盤仔，koh倒香菇素蠔油kah烏麻油，攑箸beh食ê時，看盤--裡紅、青、黃、白、烏，五彩繽紛，五隻排列做像弓箭堵ê蝦仔，加上其中一粒小可仔現出深黃ê兩粒圓白卵，拄好占滿圓盤仔邊，中ng是暗綠ê烏甜仔hām淡薄仔黃ê麵條。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Uah！Tsiok suí！Tsiok m̄甘食--neh！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我有夠爽：「讚--lah！踮庄跤讚--lah！」Tse kám kan-na『小確幸』niā-niā？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">隨kā今仔日早頓ê相片hip--起-來，beh傳LINE kā出外去真遠ê牽手展--一-下！</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></span></div><div><br /></div></span></div></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></h2><h2><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13ad